        "original_id": "5b849267-19ea-542d-b7d7-8737cbce5452",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Liz Rose, Taylor Swift\n- Songs: White Horse, Teardrops on My Guitar, You Belong with Me\n- Companies: Big Machine Records\n- Albums: Fearless\n- Awards: Grammy Award\n\nFacts:\n- On December 7, 2008, Big Machine Records released \"White Horse\" as the second single from Taylor Swift's second studio album \"Fearless\" (2008).\n- Liz Rose has co-written twenty of Taylor Swift's officially released songs and singles, including \"White Horse,\" \"Teardrops on My Guitar,\" and \"You Belong with Me.\"\n- In 2010, \"You Belong with Me\" won Liz Rose and Taylor Swift a Grammy Award.",
